{
  "_comment": "Shared condition-normalization table. Consumed by backend/tests/test_condition_normalization.py and frontend/src/lib/condition.test.js. The backend (backend/services/card_fields.py) is authoritative; frontend/src/lib/condition.js mirrors it so the dropdown offers the same grades the importer folds to. Add a spelling here ONLY when it unambiguously names the same grade \u2014 mapping one grade onto a different one restates what the seller is claiming about the card.",
